#3. Launch the Test Network. Let’s fire up a simple test network to start with. 
#This network will have two organizations (Org1 and Org2) and an orderer (the component that organizes transactions).
#Navigate to the test network directory:
cd ~/fabric-samples-old/fabcar$ 
#Run FabCar Network 
~/fabric-samples-old/fabcar$ ./startFabric.sh

