#4. Interact with JavaScript
#The output involves navigating to a JavaScript directory, installing Node.js dependencies with npm install, 
enrolling an admin identity with node enrollAdmin.js, and registering an application user with node registerUser.js for a Hyperledger Fabric application.
cd javascript
npm install  # Install dependencies
#Run node enrollAdmin.js  # Create admin identity
~/fabric-samples-old/fabcar/javascript$ node enrollAdmin.js
