#Run node registerUser.js  # Register app user
~/fabric-samples-old/fabcar/javascript$ node registerUser.js
Wallet path: /home/gregory/fabric-samples-old/fabcar/javascript/wallet
Successfully registered and enrolled admin user "appUser" and imported it into the wallet

